const flows={online:[
['Start with a message','The farmer joins the demo sandbox and chooses English or Portuguese. Onboarding collects consent, a name and a community, then asks for profile confirmation. The chat becomes the everyday interface.','Hello → EN → I AGREE → name → community → CONFIRM','Message text, provider sender identity and the farmer’s language choice.','The diagram is illustrative. The real sandbox needs a participant to join before HarvestLink can reply.'],
['A verified bridge into the account','Twilio forwards an incoming WhatsApp message to the protected handler. The provider signature is checked. Message identifiers prevent a retry from saving the same action twice.','WhatsApp → Twilio → /harvestlink-reply','Provider message ID and authenticated sender identity; server credentials stay on the backend.','The shared sandbox displays Twilio’s identity. A dedicated HarvestLink business sender is a separate setup.'],
['A small model, a controlled workflow','A learned character n-gram intent classifier recognizes supported requests. Structured extraction finds crop, quantity and other details. The workflow asks for missing fields and uses bilingual templates to review the draft.','“120 kg of tomatoes” → crop: tomato · quantity: 120 · grade: missing','Intent scores and a structured draft; then a farmer-confirmed lot.','This is a small intent model, not a general-purpose language model. Unclear inputs need clarification; templates and calculations constrain the response.'],
['One shared account across channels','The prototype stores owner-scoped records in Twilio Sync. A temporary code sent from WhatsApp, followed by confirmation, verifies a companion device. Authenticated web conversations then use the same backend session.','WhatsApp confirms pairing → review account on phone → activate','Account, confirmed lots, choices, support requests and handovers, with a shared revision.','Names never prove identity. Per-device credentials protect access; conflicting revisions require review. Production scale needs a larger database.'],
['From availability to a proposed handover','Compatible confirmed lots are pooled against demo buyer demand. Deterministic calculations compare local net earnings with the cross-border proposal using dated costs and BRL/GYD assumptions. A confirmed choice can produce an exporter handover.','Review earnings → choose proposal → CONFIRM → review handover','Confirmed lots → allocated kilograms → cost snapshot → farmer choice → handover record.','Demo orders, prices and logistics are fictional. Shipment remains awaiting buyer confirmation and trade-requirement checks. No booking, payment or dispatch is authorized.']
],offline:[
['Open the installed phone companion','Before going offline, open HarvestLink while connected, wait for the offline cache, reload and install it on the home screen. WhatsApp cannot reach the assistant without connectivity; the companion provides local capability.','Connected setup → cache ready → airplane mode → companion','Cached interface, inference runtime and model files on the device.','This walkthrough simulates offline mode. It does not change your phone’s network settings.'],
['The cache replaces the message bridge','The service worker serves the cached app. The farmer types into the companion rather than sending a WhatsApp message. No Twilio webhook or cloud inference is required for local harvest intake.','Phone input → cached app → local workflow','A local message entered on this device; nothing sent to a buyer or backend.','The app must have been cached successfully before losing signal. Browser storage can be cleared or become unavailable.'],
['The same small AI runs locally','The shipped intent model and runtime total 128,184 bytes. Inference runs in JavaScript on the device. The assistant extracts supported harvest details, asks what is missing and requires confirmation before creating a lot.','“Tenho 120 kg de tomate” → local intent → missing details → CONFIRMO','A local draft and explicit confirmation; no inference request leaves the phone.','Physical budget Android speed and airplane-mode measurements remain outstanding. Voice recognition is not enabled.'],
['Save work and resume after restarting','The companion persists its conversation and records in browser storage. Unfinished reviews can be resumed. Previously saved marketplace snapshots remain visible, with an offline warning. Export is available as a backup.','Confirm harvest → save on phone → close → reopen','Local account, conversation, drafts, lots, choices and handover records.','Saved on the phone does not mean received by the service. Market snapshots may be stale and device storage is not a guaranteed permanent backup.'],
['Reconnect, review and explicitly submit','After connectivity returns, a verified device reviews unsent work and explicitly submits it. Operation IDs make retries safe; base revisions prevent silently overwriting newer shared changes. Conflicts require review before replacement.','Reconnect → review changes → submit → service receipt','Confirmed records with an operation ID and base revision; receipt updates shared state.','Synchronization does not confirm a buyer order, book transport or clear a border. Never treat a local choice as an accepted sale.']
]};let mode='online',step=0;const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);function render(){const d=flows[mode][step];$('step-number').textContent=`STEP ${String(step+1).padStart(2,'0')} / 05`;$('mode-label').textContent=mode.toUpperCase();$('step-title').textContent=d[0];$('step-description').textContent=d[1];$('event').textContent=d[2];$('payload').textContent=d[3];$('guardrail').textContent=d[4];$('previous').disabled=step===0;$('next').disabled=step===4;for(const m of ['online','offline'])$(m).setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(mode===m));document.querySelectorAll('[data-node]').forEach(n=>{n.classList.toggle('active',Number(n.dataset.node)===step);n.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(Number(n.dataset.node)===step));});const labels=mode==='online'?['Farmer’s WhatsApp','Verified message bridge','Shared account records','Marketplace + handover']:['Phone companion','Offline service worker','Records on this phone','Review + synchronize'];[0,1,3,4].forEach((n,i)=>$('node'+n).textContent=labels[i]);const subs=mode==='online'?['English / Portuguese','Twilio → protected webhook','Owner-scoped durable storage','Pool · compare · confirm']:['Cached app · no WhatsApp delivery','No network request','Conversation + local persistence','Explicit submission on reconnect'];[0,1,3,4].forEach((n,i)=>$('sub'+n).textContent=subs[i]);}document.querySelectorAll('[data-node]').forEach(n=>n.onclick=()=>{step=Number(n.dataset.node);render();});['online','offline'].forEach(m=>$(m).onclick=()=>{mode=m;step=0;render();});$('previous').onclick=()=>{if(step>0){step--;render();}};$('next').onclick=()=>{if(step<4){step++;render();}};render();
